%% Termination (asg_termination)
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> NoticeSent : Manager starts it, or Utility debt reaches the rule (FR-ASG-09, FR-BIL-05)
  NoticeSent --> Overdue : move-out date passed (job, FR-ASG-09)
  NoticeSent --> CheckedOut : checked out at the desk (FR-ASG-06)
  Overdue --> CheckedOut : checked out at the desk (FR-ASG-06)
  NoticeSent --> TmCancelled : Manager cancels (debt paid) (FR-ASG-09)
  NoticeSent : Notice sent
  CheckedOut : Checked out
  TmCancelled : Cancelled
